    narr:narration """This hub tracks the [foundational positioning](narr:Position_ProductCategoryAsyncPlatform) of a product explicitly defined as a structured alternative to [real-time chat](narr:Position_AntiPatternRealtimeChat). Established in March 2026, the narrative centers on serving [remote teams of 10-50 people](narr:Position_TargetMarketRemoteTeams) by mitigating the friction of decision-loss. While the initial [pricing strategy](narr:Position_PricingTwelveDollars) was set at $12 per user, subsequent internal reviews indicate a shift toward a tiered model for larger groups. Recent evidence from August 2026 suggests the product is moving from conceptual positioning to [demonstrable delivery](narr:Position_Sprint4DeliveryEvidence), with the team highlighting the [shipment of an async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786700689257_1) and a [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786700689257_3) as critical milestones. These updates are framed within a context of [record-high velocity](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786700689257_2), suggesting a transition toward operational validation of the original async thesis.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786700689257_1> ;
